# Debug-only fictional data, visibly labelled. No account or transaction capabilities.
fold folded
launch dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity
expect "Today's issue"
expect Search markets
shot hunch-live-cover
# Repeatable fixture exercises details without live market churn.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity --es fixture demo
expect HUNCH / FICTIONAL DEMO
expect Paper Cranes
shot hunch-demo-cover
# Match card title (not the filter).
tap Paper Cranes vs Ink Foxes
expect Choose an outcome
expect Cranes outcome, selected
expect Buy:
expect Gross illustration
shot hunch-detail-cover
key BACK
expect "Today's issue"
tap Prices
expect DEMO above 100?
tap DEMO above 100?
expect No asks
expect No payout estimate
shot hunch-empty-book
key BACK
tap Bets
expect No bets yet.
tap Money
expect No wallet connected.
shot hunch-money-empty
tap Today
fold open
rotate portrait
expect "Today's issue"
shot hunch-demo-unfolded
# HTTP error fixture cannot fall back to unlabelled stale data.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity --es fixture error
expect Markets unavailable
shot hunch-offline
# Leave live read-only app, never the fixture, for a human.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity
expect "Today's issue"
[phone] Verify live market names, search, side selection, empty/one-sided book labels and refresh. No wallet or transaction controls. Check cover/inner readability and back to retained query.
